 oxygen to survive and thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real time Gas, Liquid and Heat Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.poster.avif?t=1763057609\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.webm?t=1763057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/5b8b01f3f2148fab776ca1ea2810e644.mp4?t=1763057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water flows and evaporates, fire requires oxygen to burn, and every tile simulates thermal capacity and conductivity. Use the simulation to your advantage to build a dynamic base, or ignore it at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm with Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.poster.avif?t=1763057609\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.webm?t=1763057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168390/extras/9f636b69fa78fd8ef46ded8cbe6febee.mp4?t=1763057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every element in the game reacts to its environment. Use dirt, seeds and water to create your farm, and manipulate the simulation to optimize your output.</p>","developers":["Klei Entertainment"]